/**
 * Factory state — snapshot builder + branch publisher (owner 2026-09-23;
 * schema 2 lifecycle-timestamps owner 2026-10-01; v3 history + backlog +
 * optional tokens owner 2026-10-03 — all additive, schema stays 2).
