A. Treat workflow_dispatch runs WITHOUT a path (shape drift / old payloads) as real (fail-open). And runs WITH a path that matches ciWorkflow → real; with a non-matching path → side-run. This keeps old tests green (no path → real) and fixes the bug (review runs carry a path — `path` is always present in real GitHub payloads: `.github/workflows/review.yml`).

