Now decision on default ciWorkflow in factoryState: `input.ciWorkflow || 'quality.yml'` — matches smAgent default. Fine.

Now, what about runs WITHOUT path that are event 'workflow_dispatch' — treated real (fail-open). Review side-runs in production always have path → classified side-run. 

